# Agent scratch, written by tooling rather than by hand. Untracked, so CI never
# sees it -- but `format:check` walks the whole tree, so a single session note
# halts the first step of `npm run verify` and takes the rest of the chain with
# it. Two agents hit that separately on 2026-08-15 and each worked around it,
# which is how the frontend chain went a whole session without being run end to
# end. Ignoring the path is cheaper than rewriting files nobody authored.
